    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being overwhelmed though. it's more like... looking at a machine that's been smashed too many times. you can glue the pieces back, but the mechanism is still gone. i look at my life and i just see something that doesn't work anymore. i dont see a person, i just see the damage. do you think some things are just too far gone to ever be whole again?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
